I am finally back in the flat.
I go into the kitchen and cook my pasta.
The dinner smells very good.
I sit at the kitchen table and eat.
Beside my plate lies my phone.
The screen suddenly lights up.
I have a new message.
I take the mobile phone and look at the display.
It is a message from my sister Sofia in Mexico.
She writes a long text.
I read the message slowly.
Sofia tells a funny story about our dog Lola.
Lola steals a shoe from our brother Diego.
I laugh out loud.
I type a quick reply to Sofia.
I send a lot of laughing emojis.
The food tastes delicious.
The day is successful and very nice.
Now I relax and enjoy the evening.
